      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ibn Mahboub, from Abu Ayoun, and Ibn Bukeyr, from Lays Al Murady who said, ",
          "‘I asked Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> about the wergild of the Christian, and the Jew, and the Magian. He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Their wergilds are all the same – eight hundred Dirhams, eight hundred Dirhams’."
        ]
      }
